{# app/views/_includes/issues/raise-fields.njk

   The body of the raise an issue form below its heading, shared by the form
   outside the workflow (issues/raise.html), the one inside reading
   (reading/workflow/raise-issue.html) and the one for falling back to manual
   images (appointments/images-troubleshooting-issue.html). Their routes read the
   answers back from data.issueTemp.raise.

   The type question is left out for now. A type chosen by the link still
   rides along in data.issueTemp.raise.type.

   Expects: answers (data.issueTemp.raise), raisedFrom and recordId. #}

<p>This problem will need to be reviewed before this participant’s episode can continue.</p>

{{ textarea({
  name: "issueTemp[raise][description]",
